# .astro is deliberately NOT formatted by prettier.
#
# prettier-plugin-astro rewrites RENDERED HTML, not just source: it
# injects whitespace inside elements, so `<a>Services</a>` becomes
# `<a> Services </a>`. Measured on this repo, that changed 4 built
# pages on default settings and 8 on htmlWhitespaceSensitivity:strict.
# A formatter that alters output cannot be run unattended, and a
# whitespace diff across 60 files is not something anyone reviews.
#
# These files are still checked — eslint-plugin-astro lints them and
# `astro check` typechecks their frontmatter and templates.
*.astro

